  * Release v0.1.0

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:37:40 -0500

homelab-block-link (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: click-to-block-link settings backend + public
    management page. Own `block_link` Postgres schema (domain_settings/
    account_settings/pending_links), /internal/v1/block-link/* fronted
    by homelab-api's /api/v1/block-link/* gateway route, and the public
    /l/:token management page. Requires homelab-api >= 0.1.30 (the
    gateway route) and homelab-domain-admin >= 0.1.22 (the on-behalf
    recipient-access endpoint this service calls).

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0500
